WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:07.485
Line Select reads your whole bid pack, asks you how you like to fly, and ranks every line in it against you —

00:00:07.485 --> 00:00:12.074
with the reason for each score, so you don't have to re-check it by hand.

00:00:12.774 --> 00:00:15.685
It works in four steps. Load your bid pack.

00:00:15.685 --> 00:00:19.409
Tell it what matters, the way you'd tell another pilot.

00:00:19.409 --> 00:00:22.117
Get every line ranked, best match first.

00:00:22.117 --> 00:00:29.022
Then check the month, and send your order over to VIPS, where you look it over and submit it yourself.

00:00:29.724 --> 00:00:33.382
A couple of things up front. Line Select is independent —

00:00:33.382 --> 00:00:38.130
it isn't made or endorsed by FedEx, and it never submits anything for you.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:43.327
And the score is how well a line fits you, not a guess at what you'll be awarded.

00:00:43.327 --> 00:00:45.252
You still check your own pack.

00:00:45.954 --> 00:00:49.735
Each chapter of this video covers one part of the site.

00:00:49.735 --> 00:00:51.522
Skip to whatever you need.

